    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> 2024-10-21</p>

    <p>I am committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring that your personal data remains secure when using InterShare. This Privacy Policy explains how I handle your data when you use the app.</p>

    <h2>1. Data Collection and Storage</h2>
    <p>InterShare does not collect, store, or process any personal data. All file transfers are conducted directly between devices (peer-to-peer), and no information is sent to or processed by any server.</p>

    <h2>2. Peer-to-Peer File Transfers</h2>
    <p>InterShare allows you to share files, photos, and videos directly between devices. These transfers are facilitated using Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE) or Wi-Fi, depending on network availability. I do not track or store any information about the files being transferred.</p>

    <h2>3. No Use of Third Parties</h2>
    <p>I operate InterShare independently and do not share information with any third-party services, analytics providers, or advertising networks. This ensures that no data is collected, tracked, or shared with any external parties while using the app.</p>

    <h2>4. Encryption and Security</h2>
    <p>To protect your files during transfer, InterShare uses XChaCha20 encryption, which ensures that your data is securely transmitted between devices. While I have made every effort to implement secure practices, please note that I am not a professional cryptographer, and the app has not been reviewed by any independent security professionals.</p>
    <p>Although I have done my best to ensure your data is handled securely, I cannot guarantee that the app is free from all potential vulnerabilities.</p>

    <h2>5. Your Rights Under GDPR</h2>
    <p>As InterShare does not collect or process personal data, there are no personal data records to access, modify, or delete. If you have any questions or concerns about data privacy in relation to the app, please feel free to contact me.</p>

    <h2>6. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
    <p>I may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected by updating the "Effective Date" at the top of this page. I encourage you to review this policy periodically.</p>

